WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.031
A picture graph shows mango 3, orange 2 and banana 6 votes. How many votes did the

00:00:06.031 --> 00:00:10.832
most popular fruit get? Let us think carefully. Compare the three totals and choose

00:00:10.832 --> 00:00:13.576
the largest. The answer is 6. Great work!

